WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.160
Contract Reviews holds the synthetic agreement and its later amendment.

2
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:10.500
Typed by Claude (automated test) as contract manager: submits through MCP.

3
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:23.280
The report quotes the replacing clause and its parsed cap value.

4
00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:36.780
AI locates clause identifiers; code checks keywords, amendments, values and playbook positions.

5
00:00:36.780 --> 00:00:41.780
Typed by Claude (automated test) as lawyer: opens the decision form.

6
00:00:42.220 --> 00:00:54.720
Typed by Claude (automated test) as lawyer: records rejection and fallback request.

7
00:00:54.720 --> 00:01:01.460
The matching decision resumes the waiting contract-review workflow.

8
00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:09.420
The review returns the fallback request from the automated lawyer-role decision.
